This project adapts the CLI-provider bridge pattern to Tencent CodeBuddy CLI.
The CodeBuddy process runner, stream-json normalization, DSH structured-tool
mapping, configuration, commands and tests are implemented for this project.
It does not include, redistribute, or bypass authentication for CodeBuddy.
It is not an official Tencent or DeepSeek product.
